{"abstract":"This website accompanies the research into the Danish Game Industry Timeline. The timeline collects landmarks and events to present an overview of Danish digital game development. The website enables ongoing communication and revision of timeline in dialog with community. On this website, and on the parallel spiltidslinje.dk (TBA), we update further versions of the timeline. We also credit everyone who contributes and make changes visible.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Poulsen, Mark Staun","Wirman, Hanna Elina"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-860994"],"filters":{"added":"2026-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Danish game industry","History","Interest representation","Policy","Timeline"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"blog danish game industry timeline","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.gamestimeline.dk","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-860994","ids":["itu-67b0453a-ddd7-44cd-99c0-dbccc7abc1aa"],"keyword":["Danish game industry","History","Interest representation","Policy","Timeline"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EC586AB7D816E6736212FBCF7A88951C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.gamestimeline.dk","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Digital Play","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI"],"nora_code":"DI-U